notes on requirements: 
- business day trades - trades in a location stick to the tz for that location
- round half up on calculated fee
- currency calc: use rate conversion at invoice time for each line
- each line in invoce is added to get total
- no duplicate invoice in a listing (pages of invoice)
- we expect reconciliation efforts
- export invoices to JSON

- other services like billing and recon depend on invoicing (watch out for side effects)